            "title": "Our Policy & Commitment",
            "text": "<p>At Solace London, we are committed to accessibility and inclusion. We want solacelondon.com to be accessible to as many people as possible, including customers with disabilities, and we treat accessibility as an ongoing part of how we design, build and test our site. We are working towards conformance with WCAG 2.2 Level AA and EN 301549, the European standard for ICT accessibility referenced by the European Accessibility Act, and have regard to the UK Equality Act 2010.&nbsp;</p><p>Last reviewed: August, 2026</p>",
